+writeFileSync(
+	join(folder, 'README.md'),
+	`# kvstore requests\n\nThe requests other teams filed with the storage team about kvstore between 6 July and 13 November 2026,\none file each with its whole thread, as the old tracker exported them on 20 November. The export kept the\ndescriptions and replies but not the statuses or tags. Numbers missing from the sequence were the storage\nteam's own tasks, which are not part of this export.\n`
